                <formatted-text>
                  <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>This dashboard combines a world map of annual inflation with a ranked COVID impact bar chart. The map uses capped inflation values for colour encoding, while tooltips retain the original inflation values. The bar chart compares average inflation during 2020–2022 with the pre-COVID average from 2017–2019.</run>
